---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Company" description="Official company-level updates from The Boring Company.">
  <p class="muted" style="margin-top: 2rem;"><a href="/sections">← All sections</a></p>
  <span class="card-category" style="margin-top: 1rem; display:inline-block;">Company</span>
  <h1 class="section-title" style="margin-top: 0.5rem;">Company</h1>
  <div class="article-body" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
    <p>Company-level coverage includes hiring, partnerships, safety and training exercises, official organisational statements, and other primary-source news that is not tied to a single project or machine.</p>
    <h2 style="margin-top: 2rem; font-size: 1.2rem;">What you will find here</h2>
    <ul style="margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem 1.25rem; color: var(--text-muted);">
      <li>Hiring events and team expansion announcements</li>
      <li>Partnerships with agencies or other organisations</li>
      <li>Safety, security, and training updates from official posts</li>
      <li>Broad company statements that are not project-specific</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Valuation gossip and secondary commentary are excluded.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>